WEBVTT

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:33.470
At last, the plotter behind...

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.870
...this latest feud in the
Seyruun family was revealed!

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:38.880
It turned out to be
Amelia's cousin Alfred.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:43.150
Just then, Kanzel and Mazenda
turned on him and killed him!

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:45.810
Besides that, Kanzel tried to get me
to swear allegiance to the Monsters...

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:48.720
...in return for Phil's life!

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.520
Hey! You've gotta be kidding!

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:52.530
There's no way I can
do something like that!

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:15.910
All right! Now's the time to ask
the monstrous Zoamelgustar for help!

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.720
Just buy a pendant
and you'll be safe!

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:19.980
I'll take one!

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.720
Me, too!

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:23.050
Thanks! Come again!

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:27.890
Where am I?!
What's happening?!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.660
So, you're awake now.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:31.360
Wh- Who are you?!

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:35.390
I am Xellos, the Mysterious Priest,
who was passing by.

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:39.410
It looks like you've been out cold
since the Monsters took you hostage.

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:43.710
What?! That's right! I was captured
by those suspicious characters!

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:45.510
What's happened since then?!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:49.680
Well, I think Lina and the
others have been fighting them.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:51.580
They're WHAT?!
I can't just sit here, then!

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:53.810
Um, I don't think
you'll find them that way.

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:58.190
Lina and the others
are fighting up THERE.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.190
What's that?!

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:10.000
Where's Amelia?
Where's my dear Amelia?!

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:12.470
I believe she's with Lina.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:26.490
Paternal Love...

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.050
...Smashing Burst Jump!

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:38.890
Oh, too bad!
You nearly made it, too!

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:48.740
Okay, now it's
your turn, Kanzel!

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:54.640
You managed to
beat Mazenda so easily...

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:57.680
Gee, aren't you taking it well.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.590
I prefer to play things
a bit smarter than she did.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.020
I'll say this just once more!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:07.830
Lina Inverse! Swear allegiance to my
master, Gaav, the Demon Dragon King!

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:13.330
Do that and I will let you
and your companions live!

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.600
No, thank you!

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:15.930
No matter how hard you
guys try to recruit me...

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.340
...l'll never
willingly help a Monster!

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:22.770
Humans really can be such fools...

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.710
And you really have
a limit on your power.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:28.750
With the partner you were needed to
fight for you now dead, someone whose...

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:30.750
...only power is dimensional
manipulation has no chance!

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.790
Exactly! In the end,
evil will be destroyed...

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:34.950
...in the face of
the might of Justice!

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:39.390
If you insist on saying that,
then know the true power I possess!

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:45.420
Gourry!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.830
You can have this back!

00:04:58.180 --> 00:04:59.740
Elmekia Lance!

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:08.380
I don't even have to defend
against such a weak spell!

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.720
Oh! It didn't
affect him at all!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.590
Well, then, how about this?!

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:13.920
RAH TILT!!!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.300
Got him!

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:21.030
The strongest astral plane
spell there is... Maybe this...

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:40.290
Was that the best he could do?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.020
Zel!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.190
ZEL!

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:51.560
Dimensional manipulation allows
me to do this as well!

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:54.030
You lousy!

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.700
Huh? What the?!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:07.810
I admit that the Rah Tilt and the Sword
of Light DO cause me some discomfort.

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:17.280
So, this is Kanzel's true power!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:19.490
This is nuts!
I can't do anything...

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.550
...against his dimensional
manipulation powers!

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:27.130
Exactly. There's no way
any of you can touch me!

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:30.570
This has actually
gotten too serious for puns.

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:35.910
Wh- Where is he?!

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:39.870
AMELIA!

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:46.250
What's happening up there?!

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.250
Please, please, calm down.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:54.290
That group can handle a
problem like this. Besides...

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:59.600
If they can't handle something like
this, it'll cause trouble for ME.

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:01.100
Hm? What did you say?

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:02.830
Oh, no! Nothing!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.270
Really?

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.240
R- Really...

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:05.970
Master Xellos!

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.200
Huh? That voice!

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:11.970
Master Xell... o-o-o-os!

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:19.920
I've been wondering where you've been
since we were separated, Master Xellos!

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:23.290
But look how much money I've earned
to take over the world with!

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:25.780
Where'd it go?! Where'd it go?!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.130
Amelia!

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:35.330
BLAM BLAZER!

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:41.570
I told you that would do no good!
Don't you understand that yet?!

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:44.070
Rah Tilt!

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:50.340
Go get 'em, Gourry!

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:57.160
Just nicked him!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:00.590
That was close. But you
won't get a second chance!

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.870
Dammit! He can do
anything he wants to us!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:16.200
Ooh! Why can't I use my
spells at a time like this?!

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:37.160
That's a fine situation
you're in, Lina Inverse.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:39.500
I'll give you
just one more chance.

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:43.370
Agree to use your powers
for our master, Lord Gaav!

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:45.170
Enough already!

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:48.700
Lina Inverse wouldn't work for
you guys, even if you killed me!

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.870
In that case...

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.000
St...

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:19.830
STOP IT!!!!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.950
L- Lina...

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:47.230
You bastard! Lina can't!

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:52.300
She... She can't
use levitation now...

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:57.380
Too bad for her.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:01.980
How dare you...

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:05.280
How dare you! YOU!!!

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:11.120
Relax. I'll send you
all to her soon enough.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.730
"Darkness beyond twilight..."

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:17.060
"Crimson beyond blood that flows!
Buried in the flow of time..."

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:21.130
"ln thy great name,
I pledge myself to darkness."

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.170
Lina?!

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:24.800
That spell!

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.270
Look! There she is!

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:29.610
"...by the power you and I possess!"

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:33.310
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:20.720
Lina! You're all right?!

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:24.230
Of course I am!
I'm right here, aren't I?

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:27.670
But with your powers
sealed away, how could you?

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:31.040
Simple.
My powers suddenly came back.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:33.770
It happened right
after we killed Mazenda.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.040
What? You mean?

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:39.140
Yeah. Mazenda was the one
who put the seal on my powers.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:46.180
Once her power was gone, it's not
surprising mine came back.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:50.960
Of course, there was a chance that
her spell would have stayed in place...

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:52.990
...but it looks like it didn't.

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:56.930
And so after that, you pretended
you still didn't have your powers...

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:00.300
...and waited to
get a shot at Kanzel?

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.000
You got it. It was all a bluff.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.040
You mean you lied to us, too?!

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:10.110
"If you can fool your friends,
you can fool your enemies."

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:12.410
That hurt!
What's the big idea?!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.410
Look...

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:17.010
Can you consider my
feelings a little next time?

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.480
S- Sorry...

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:23.620
Your feelings? Your feelings?

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:26.460
That's the first time
Mr. Gourry's talked that way...

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:28.460
...since he and Miss Lina met!

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:31.390
Come on, Mr. Zelgadis!
Let's go back ahead of them.

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:32.630
What? Hey!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.760
Did I say something wrong?

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:37.470
Wait! Amelia! Wait up!

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:44.940
Do you think?

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:46.110
Kanzel!

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:51.640
You caught me off guard, but it
apparently wasn't enough to kill me.

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:55.380
It can't be! He could
stand up to a Dragon Slave?!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.580
I wouldn't talk
so tough if I were you.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:59.720
It looks like you
took a lot of damage.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:02.930
I'm still quite strong
enough to kill you all!

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:05.320
What?!

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:29.590
An ordinary Monster wouldn't
have stood a chance against you...

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:34.860
...but for one like me, it only
caused a bit of discomfort!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:37.520
Look out!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:44.730
I won't just kill you! I'll wring
every bit of pain and fear from you!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.540
Sorry!

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:59.710
Careful! He'll try jumping
dimensions to get us again!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.660
Rah Tilt!

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:22.610
That's it! Fear and despair!
Let those feelings loose!

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:35.350
Damn... He can
withstand a Dragon Slave.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:38.150
That only leaves
that other spell to try!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:43.290
But hitting him will be tricky!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.430
Unless...

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:51.530
Kanzel! One more showdown!
All or nothing on this one!

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:56.410
"Lord of Darkness of the
Four Worlds! I call upon you!"

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:01.240
"Grant me all the power
that you possess!"

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:04.050
That's...
A magic amplification spell?!

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:07.910
"Sword of the cold, dark void..."

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:10.250
"...free yourself
from the heavens' bonds!"

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:12.380
"Become one with my power,
one with my body..."

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:14.900
"...and let us walk the path
of destruction together!"

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:17.730
"Power that can smash even
the souls of the gods!"

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:20.130
RAGNA BLADE!!!

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.270
That's...

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.070
The Ragna Blade...

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:28.410
Let's go!

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:31.970
You fool! No matter how powerful
a spell you might summon...

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:33.840
...it means nothing
if you can't hit me!

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:36.540
Don't you understand that?!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:39.250
The last time I used it,
the Ragna Blade was able...

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:42.350
...to cut through the
barrier Kanzel created.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:46.150
Which means even if Kanzel retreats
into that dimension of his...

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:50.760
Slash, Sword of Darkness!
Slash through all!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.000
It didn't work?

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:02.800
lm... Impossible...

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:09.750
It cut through... the dimensional
wall... A mere human has!

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:14.090
If you hadn't been so careless,
you could have beaten us.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:17.420
But you underestimated us,
and that's why you've lost!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:21.190
Now die, creature of darkness!

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:37.380
Even with my powers back, I can only
maintain it for a short period of time.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:38.810
Lina!

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.040
Miss Lina, you did it!

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:44.180
Piece of cake
for me to handle...

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:48.210
...is what I'd LIKE to say,
but that was really a close one.

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:50.490
You're crazy, you know that?

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:52.620
Still, for it to have cut
through the dimensional wall...

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.630
...the Ragna Blade must have
the power to cut through anything.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:59.160
I guess. The idea just
popped into my head.

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:02.530
Wh- What?

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:06.470
Is something coming again?!
Hey! Look!

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:13.440
I... I think when Kanzel
was killed, the power holding...

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:15.850
...this chunk of earth
up vanished with him!

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:19.580
You... You mean
we're falling now?!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:23.160
If it does, then Seyruun City
below us will be!

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:25.280
Miss Lina, what'll we do?!

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.590
That's a good
question, actually...

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:29.360
First of all,
let's get out of here!

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:41.640
Now what's happening?

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:43.140
Who knows?

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:45.240
What's that?

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:47.010
It looks like
Lina and the others.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.780
TROUBLE!!!

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:51.920
Amelia! You're all okay!

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:54.180
Daddy, we're in big trouble!

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:58.250
What's wrong, Amelia?
You all escaped safely.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.290
That means you killed
those Monsters, right?

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:04.530
Forget the Monsters! That floating
piece of land is falling!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.900
What do you mean?

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:08.400
Now that we killed the
Monster who was holding it up...

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:10.340
...it'll fall down any minute now!

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:11.900
It'll WHAT?!

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:14.640
And it's on a collision
course with Seyruun, isn't it?

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:17.080
Oh, this is it!

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:21.110
Everyone will know me as the
girl who destroyed Seyruun!

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:24.550
Can't you use a spell
to blow that thing up?!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.750
It's a little
too big to take on.

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:29.050
The best I can do is
blow it into three pieces.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:31.750
Come on! Let's all
pray to Zoamelgustar!

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:33.660
Would you please be serious?!

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:35.220
So, this is
the way Seyruun ends...

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.630
Don't talk like
it's not your problem!!!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.070
Why are you all
getting so upset?

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:43.300
If this doesn't get you upset,
what the hell DOES?!

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:44.700
Have you forgotten?

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:48.070
You have your
powers back, right?

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:52.380
If you use the talismen, a Dragon
Slave would do the trick, right?

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:55.140
A magically-amplified
Dragon Slave?

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:58.210
That's it!
It's our only hope!

00:18:58.290 --> 00:18:59.750
That's right, Miss Lina!

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:03.480
All right... All or nothing!

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:08.150
"Lord of Darkness of the
Four Worlds! I call upon you!"

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:12.360
"Grant me all the power
that you possess!"

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:14.130
"Darkness beyond twilight..."

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:17.230
"Crimson beyond blood that flows!
Buried in the flow of time..."

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:20.930
"ln thy great name,
I pledge myself to darkness."

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:24.380
"Let all the fools who stand
in our way be destroyed..."

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:28.280
"...by the power
you and I possess!"

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:31.250
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:40.950
Just this once, I'll ask you!
Please save Seyruun, Lord Shabranigdo!

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.360
Don't pray to Dark Lords!

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:43.620
Aren't you a shrine maiden?!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.600
Oh, it was worth a try!

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:53.500
Well done, Lina!

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:59.440
I guess I overdid it a little...

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:15.290
It's all over, isn't it?

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.760
I feel sort of sorry for Alfred.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:21.630
If only he'd never
met those Monsters...

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:24.640
No, it wasn't the
Monsters who tempted him.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.200
He was consumed
by his own ambition.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.210
The result was to be expected...

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.180
But!

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.410
More than that...

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:34.410
What is it the
Monsters are up to?

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:36.420
There was also that
business back in Atlas City.

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:39.080
It looks like some
sort of huge plot is unfolding.

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:41.960
Yeah...
Gaav, the Demon Dragon King...

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:45.080
And somehow I'm linked to it...

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:49.860
Which means it looks like
our troubles aren't over yet.
